    "title": "How Many Points Did Cooper Flagg Score Tonight Against The Suns? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shabiha Akter ,\n28 minutes ago\nDillon Brooks and Cooper Flagg (Photo By Imagn Images) After parting ways with their GM Nico Harrison , the Dallas Mavericks took the court for their first game on Wednesday. Mavs rookie Cooper Flagg once again delivered a strong performance. However, the team fell 114-123 to the Phoenix Suns at American Airlines Center.\nFlagg finished Wednesday’s game against the Suns with 16 points, six rebounds, and six assists. He also contributed three steals, two blocks, and three three-pointers made.\nDuring the game, Flagg briefly left the court holding his shoulder after a hard hit. However, he returned and logged 34 minutes of playing time.\nDespite his efforts, the Mavericks suffered the loss that dropped their record to 3-9. Flagg has already acknowledged that the reality of the NBA is hitting hard after this rare stretch of defeats. The latest loss added further frustration for both him and the team.\nThe post How Many Points Did Cooper Flagg Score Tonight Against The Suns? originally published on Total Pro Sports .",
